<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?><Content Author="Frictional Dogs" Dependencies="" Description_english="Hnenri was only moments from escaping the Bunker, the Beast close behind, when reality gave way beneath his feet. &#10;&#10;Now he finds himself stranded in an impossible city of glass. He feels lighter here. Faster, even?&#10;&#10;But rifts between worlds do not open in only one direction. Henri may not be the only thing that crossed over...&#10;&#10;Keep moving. Find a way home. And be wary of the spaces between spaces. They are not meant for us.&#10;&#10;=======================&#10;&#10;Bunker's Edge is a fast-paced parkour mod created for the Frictional Games 2026 Modding Jam under the theme “What is reality?”, and as an homage to Mirror's Edge. I really love that game and wanted to make something fun and cool that people may not expect to see in the Amnesia game, and this is the result!&#10;&#10;=======================&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: Some of the mod programming was created with the assistance of Ai coding tools. " Description_spanish="Esto es una plantilla base para crear mapas personalizados." HotLoad="false" InitCfg="config/main_init.cfg" LauncherPic="LauncherPic.png" Title="Bunker's Edge" Type="StandAlone" UID="" Version="1.0"/>